  "version": "3",
  "about": "The facets every card is described with, and the words each facet may use. A word not listed here is still accepted and shows up in `astaui ontology proposals`, so the vocabulary grows from what real cards needed. Change it when the data shows a facet or a word is missing or useless, and log why under `changes`.",
